   │  │  All 13 `given` cases in `hydrateNestedDomainObjects.test.ts` use `toMatchSnapshot()` on both happy-path outputs and error messages. The snapshot file is fully populated with readable, descriptive entries — class names and nested structure are visible in PR diffs. The `.contract` tests in `DomainObject.test.ts` also snapshot both the JSON schema output and the error message.
   │  │  
