   │  │  
   │  │  The 13 cases collectively cover the full user journey for the bug fix:
   │  │  
   │  │  - **Primary bug journey** (case1): `new Seaturtle({ forage: { slug: 'seagrass' } })` → `instanceof SeaturtleForageSpecies` — the core fix
   │  │  - **Scope disambiguation** (case1 t1): `forage: { include, exclude }` → `instanceof SeaturtleForageScope`
   │  │  - **All error paths** (case2, case3, case4 t2, case5 t0/t1): no-fit, ambiguous, undeclared `_dobj`, non-strict options
