   │  │  - **Edge cases** (case6, case10, case11, case13): already-instantiated, null, single-option fast path, empty object
   │  │  - **Array-valued keys** (case9): mixed-option arrays hydrate element-by-element
   │  │  - **Cross-schema-lib** (case7): joi works alongside zod
   │  │  
   │  │  This is a library, not an API — no `.acceptance.test.ts` is expected. The unit tests here *are* the journey tests; they exercise the library at its public contract boundary (`new DomainObject(props)`).
